<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech central bank sets one-week repo tender.</title>
<headline>Czech central bank sets one-week repo tender.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said on Wednesday it would hold a one-week repo tender, May 23 to May 30, to drain liquidity from the market.</p>
<p>The CNB said yields would be determined by bids.</p>
